 "applies_to": "Sierra InnovaSonic 207i ultrasonic (transit-time) liquid flow meters with the BACnet MS/TP option module.",
 "summary": "The InnovaSonic 207i is a clamp-on ultrasonic liquid flow meter that can also calculate thermal energy. With its BACnet MS/TP module it exposes 23 Analog Inputs (flow, velocity, flow and energy totals, temperatures, pressure, density, enthalpy, signal diagnostics and two error-flag words) and one Analog Value to reset the totalizers.",
