  "From section 4.3, BACnet Supported Device, Object and Property Table (manual pages 17-26), and 4.4.2 for AV-1. The quick-start guide P/N 47-0572-A lists the same 23 AI + 1 AV.",
  "Object names are the Object Name property values from the table; several differ from the row labels (for example AI-7 \"+ Energy Tot\").",
  "Flow, total, pressure and density units follow the units chosen in the meter menu. No read/write column is printed; only AV-1 is described as writable."
